  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in se\xE7ti\u011Fin kart, \"Kupa As\u0131\" {{isim}}.\n\nBir
    insan, bir teklif ya da bir olay, senin i\xE7in f\u0131rsata d\xF6n\xFC\u015Fm\xFC\u015F.
    De\u011Ferlendirmeye ba\u015Flamakta da hi\xE7 gecikmemi\u015Fsin. \u0130leti\u015Fimlerin
    ve \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmalar\u0131n artm\u0131\u015F. Sen \xE7abalar\u0131ndan
    netice ald\u0131k\xE7a, hayat seni ba\u015Fka g\xFCzel haberlerle de desteklemi\u015F.
    Kart\u0131n, etraf\u0131nda uzun s\xFCre \xF6nce belirmeye ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015F
    olan mutluluk par\u0131lt\u0131lar\u0131ndan s\xF6z ediyor. De\u011Fi\u015Fmeye,
    geli\u015Fmeye, yenilenmeye ve \xE7o\u011Falmaya ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    K\u0131r\u0131nt\u0131larla beslemeyi ihmal etmedi\u011Fin k\xFC\xE7\xFCc\xFCk
    ku\u015Flar, sana kocaman k\u0131smetler ta\u015F\u0131maya ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015F!"
